WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:02.650
- The CIFAR Winter
School really allowed me

00:00:03.597 --> 00:00:06.750
to see how different and
rich the approaches could be

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:11.750
even to the same problem on
which I myself specialized.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.600
- There are so many people
from very different backgrounds

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.080
diverse backgrounds,
different stages of the career

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.550
and all open minded and willing
to discuss and dialogue.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.650
- Now I can talk to people
from different fields

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.340
about different things,
and that basically gave me

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.120
a broader perspective on what science is.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.710
- For those of you that are really looking

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.690
for a unique opportunity

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:39.900
to both build a sense of
community and research,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.762
but also strengthen
interdisciplinary connections,

00:00:42.762 --> 00:00:45.570
I would encourage you to apply now.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.987
(soft music)

